    <defName>RM_WardenMother</defName>
    <label>warden mother</label>
    <description>Barnacled, scarred, and older than anything else that swims these shallows — you can see it in how slowly she moves now. She goes wherever the water goes, and nowhere else; the few metres of dry ground between her and anything on land might as well be another world. Lethal to anything she can reach. Not tame, not tameable, and not gentle — but she remembers who freed her young from a drying pool, and she will not touch you for it.</description>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>crushing bite</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>22</power>
        <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>HeadAttackTool</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
